{"scene_id": "s01233", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01233.fountain", "heading": "INT. COURTHOUSE - EMPTY COURTROOM 4B - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "NADIRA SULTANOVA", "names": ["NADIRA SULTANOVA", "NADIRA"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 20}, {"id": 1, "name": "ELIAS THORNQUIST", "names": ["ELIAS THORNQUIST", "ELIAS"], "gender": "m", "first": 20, "spoke": 14}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. COURTHOUSE - EMPTY COURTROOM 4B - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A mid-size municipal court, the kind with fake wood panelling and a drop ceiling.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Fluorescent tubes buzz.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Half the lights are off, leaving the jury box in gloom and the bench in a pool of white.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Chairs are stacked in the gallery.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "A cleaning cart stands abandoned by the door, its mop bucket still steaming.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "NADIRA SULTANOVA (40s, sharp tailoring gone limp after a fourteen-hour day, hair clipped up with a pen) stands in the well of the court with a legal pad.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "She faces the empty jury box.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "She is alone with the room.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Or she thinks she is.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, the state will tell you that my client is a liar.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the jury box"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "She waits.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "The jury box regards her.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They will tell you he lied about the ledger, about the date, about the signature.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["to the jury box"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "She turns a page.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Too long. Cut the signature.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["muttering"], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "She crosses out a line with her pen.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind her, a soft cough.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She spins.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "In the back row, half-hidden by the stacked chairs, sits ELIAS THORNQUIST (70s, retired bailiff, grey cleaners' overalls, thick glasses held together with tape).", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "A paperback lies on his knee.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "He is not reading it.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How long have you been there?", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["to Elias"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Since the second part.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which part is that?", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The part where you said \"ledger\" like it was a bad word.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Nadira studies him.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "The tube above her flickers and settles.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm rehearsing. The trial starts at nine.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know. I'll be sitting at the back.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're a bailiff?", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Was. Thirty-one years. Now I clean the brass.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Wonderful. A critic.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the room, dry"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias grins, a quick crooked flash.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You want a critique?", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I want a jury.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not got one. Got me.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "She exhales through her nose.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Takes a step toward him, the legal pad hanging at her side.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fine. Tell me.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You open with the word \"liar.\" Don't.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the state's word.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's still your first word. They'll remember it.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "She stops.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Absorbs this.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks back at the jury box as if seeing it for the first time.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's right.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["muttering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm always right. It's the curse of the cleaning staff.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What would you open with?", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Elias"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'd open with the weather.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The weather.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thirty-one years, I never saw a juror hear a word in the first minute. They're looking for their umbrellas. Give them something to hold. Say it rained that night.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It did rain.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then say that.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "She turns to the empty jury box.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Draws a breath.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Straightens her spine.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It rained on the night of the fourteenth.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the jury box"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias nods once.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind him the mop bucket gives a final hiss.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It rained, and a man went to a bank, and he signed his name.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["to the jury box"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Better.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Shut up. I'm working.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Elias"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "He mimes zipping his lips.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "She almost smiles.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "She goes on, quieter, rolling each phrase slowly, and he follows her with his eyes, lips moving a half-second behind her words like an old pew regular who has heard the liturgy a thousand times.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "She finishes.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "The tubes buzz.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ladies and gentlemen.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["softly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ladies and gentlemen.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the jury box"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "She bows her head.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "The empty box does not applaud.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias stands, tucks his paperback under his arm, picks up the mop, and begins on the floor by the door.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Weather.", "name": "NADIRA", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["muttering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "transition", "text": "FADE OUT.", "present": [0, 1]}]}